ArcadeDB release signing keys

This file holds the public OpenPGP keys that sign ArcadeDB releases: the Maven Central artifacts and the
SHA256SUMS file attached to each GitHub release. Container images and release assets are also signed with
cosign keyless; SECURITY.md ("Verifying releases") describes both.

Import the keys with:

    curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArcadeData/arcadedb/main/KEYS | gpg --import

Then check the fingerprint of the key that made a signature against the table below. Never trust a key
only because it is in your keyring.

  Fingerprint                                   Used for
  84BC E850 6583 E8FC 20BE  FEAD 1FA7 72BE 48D5 DB9A   releases after 26.11.1 (ArcadeDB Release Signing)
  F3F3 4F5F CBA9 CBD5 02A5  DA0E F060 7669 1BEF 0134   releases up to and including 26.11.1

The older key is not revoked: signatures it made on earlier releases remain valid.

